## Proposed Changes

### [NEW] `live-subtitle-extension/manifest.json`
* Configures Manifest V3.
* Sets permissions: `["tabCapture", "offscreen", "activeTab"]`.
* Defines service worker background script.
* Configures action popup (`popup/popup.html`).

### [NEW] `live-subtitle-extension/popup/popup.html`
* Sleek, high-contrast dark theme UI.
* Displays status indicator (ACTIVE / INACTIVE / ERROR).
* Includes "Start Capture" and "Stop Capture" buttons.
* Real-time audio level meter bar (canvas / visual element).
* Audio specs readout: Sample Rate (e.g. 48000 Hz), Channels (Stereo/Mono), Frames Processed, Peak Level (dB/%).
* Audio Verification action: "Download 5s Sample WAV".
* WebSocket toggle/status indicator for localhost integration.
* Helpful error banner for invalid tabs or permission failures.

### [NEW] `live-subtitle-extension/popup/popup.css`
* Modern dark-mode palette (slate gray, cyan highlights, neon status LEDs).
* Smooth transitions for metering bar and capture buttons.

### [NEW] `live-subtitle-extension/popup/popup.js`
* Listens to start/stop button clicks.
* Sends `START_CAPTURE` and `STOP_CAPTURE` messages to background service worker.
* Subscribes to real-time status and audio metering updates from background/offscreen.
* Handles WAV sample download request and error display.

### [NEW] `live-subtitle-extension/background/service-worker.js`
* Listens for start capture trigger from popup.
* Obtains active tab ID (`chrome.tabs.query`).
* Calls `chrome.tabCapture.getMediaStreamId({ targetTabId })`.
* Creates/ensures `chrome.offscreen` document exists (`offscreen/offscreen.html`).
* Forwards stream ID to offscreen document.
* Manages tab lifecycle (tab closed, tab updated) to automatically clean up stream sessions.

### [NEW] `live-subtitle-extension/offscreen/offscreen.html`
* HTML container for `offscreen.js`.

### [NEW] `live-subtitle-extension/offscreen/offscreen.js`
* Obtains tab `MediaStream` using `navigator.mediaDevices.getUserMedia` with `chromeMediaSourceId`.
* Constructs `AudioContext`, `MediaStreamAudioSourceNode`, `AnalyserNode`.
* Routes source node to `audioContext.destination` (speaker pass-through).
* Runs periodic audio level extraction (RMS/Peak) and posts diagnostic messages to runtime.
* Collects recent audio frames into a ring buffer for WAV file export.
* Prepares lightweight PCM chunk streaming interface over WebSocket (`ws://localhost:8765`) ready for Module 2.
* Cleans up tracks and closes AudioContext upon `STOP_CAPTURE`.

### [NEW] `live-subtitle-extension/audio/audio-processor.js`
* Contains clean utility functions for:
  * Audio level computation (RMS & Peak dB conversions).
  * PCM Float32 to Int16 conversion and resampling helpers.
  * RIFF WAV encoder for exporting captured PCM buffers into downloadable `.wav` blobs.

### [NEW] `live-subtitle-extension/README.md`
* Step-by-step Chrome installation guide (Developer mode -> Load unpacked).
* Quick start testing instructions (Tests 1 through 5).
* Verification guide (Audio level meter + WAV export).
* Architecture details & error handling documentation.

